														<r3d:remarks>Description:
&quot;The eagle-i National Network and eagle-i resource search at www.eagle-.net was retired on November 4, 2021.!!! Groundbreaking biomedical research requires access to cutting edge scientific resources; however such resources are often invisible beyond the laboratories or universities where they were developed. eagle-i is a discovery platform that helps biomedical scientists find previously invisible, but highly valuable, resources.&quot;

